# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets — cache policy.
# WHY no-cache everywhere: the build assigns per-law filenames lNNNN by enumerate
# index over sorted groups, so a given lNNNN can map to a DIFFERENT law after any
# rebuild. Edge/browser caching of these would serve a stale file under a reused
# name → wrong law shown. Until filenames are content-stable, every asset must
# revalidate (cheap 304 via ETag when unchanged). Fixes the recurring
# "redeploy masked by cached laws.json" gotcha (kickoff §3).
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
